{
  "model": "IndexTeam/IndexTTS-2.5",
  "voice": "温暖自然英式女老师｜IndexTTS2.5 慢速教学",
  "pause_seconds": 0.7,
  "chunks": [
    {
      "id": "s25-p01",
      "text": "There are lots of things that cause stress, such as school problems, arguments with friends and bad feelings about ourselves.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s25-p01.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s25-p01.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s25-p02",
      "text": "It's important to manage stress properly and reduce its influence.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s25-p02.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s25-p02.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s25-p03",
      "text": "Here are some helpful tips for dealing with stress.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s25-p03.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s25-p03.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s25-p04",
      "text": "Do you always wait until Sunday evening to do homework?",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s25-p04.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s25-p04.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s25-p05",
      "text": "This bad habit can cause last-minute stress, as well as poor grades.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s25-p05.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s25-p05.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s25-p06",
      "text": "To avoid that, time management is greatly needed.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s25-p06.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s25-p06.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s25-p07",
      "text": "Plan your studies with a calendar.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s25-p07.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s25-p07.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s25-p08",
      "text": "You can also divide big projects into smaller tasks.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s25-p08.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s25-p08.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s25-p09",
      "text": "Besides, staying organised is very important for reducing stress.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s25-p09.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s25-p09.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s25-p10",
      "text": "Do the necessary housework.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s25-p10.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s25-p10.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s25-p11",
      "text": "Pack your school bag well.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s25-p11.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s25-p11.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s25-p12",
      "text": "Use your shelves at home to keep things in order.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s25-p12.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s25-p12.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s25-p13",
      "text": "Be sure to eat healthy meals and get at least 8 hours of sleep.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s25-p13.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s25-p13.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s25-p14",
      "text": "Avoid checking your mobile phone or using the computer before bedtime.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s25-p14.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s25-p14.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s25-p15",
      "text": "It will keep you awake and make things worse.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s25-p15.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s25-p15.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s25-p16-01",
      "text": "When you're feeling stressed, it's helpful to speak to someone who understands your situation, such as a friend,",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s25-p16-01.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s25-p16-01.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s25-p16-02",
      "text": "your husband or wife or an elder family member.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s25-p16-02.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s25-p16-02.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s25-p17",
      "text": "Sometimes just sharing your feelings is enough.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s25-p17.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s25-p17.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s25-p18",
      "text": "Other times, however, you might need advice.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s25-p18.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s25-p18.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s25-p19",
      "text": "Don't keep your worries to yourself.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s25-p19.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s25-p19.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s25-p20",
      "text": "Finally, relaxation is important.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s25-p20.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s25-p20.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s25-p21",
      "text": "Do simple things like having a warm shower to calm yourself.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s25-p21.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s25-p21.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s25-p22",
      "text": "Find some free time for activities that you enjoy.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s25-p22.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s25-p22.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s25-p23",
      "text": "For example, you can go skating or skiing.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s25-p23.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s25-p23.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s25-p24",
      "text": "Walk in your village or town.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s25-p24.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s25-p24.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s25-p25",
      "text": "Fly a kite in the park or meet and hang out with friends.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s25-p25.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s25-p25.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s25-p26",
      "text": "If you relax and enjoy yourself, you'll feel refreshed, have more energy and reduce your level of stress.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s25-p26.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s25-p26.mp3"
    }
  ],
  "word_audio": "browser speech synthesis en-GB"
}
